# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler"
msgstr "Transpiler"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler {#transpiler}"
msgstr "Transpileur {#transpiler}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") function is a flexible and convenient tool to build a [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) that can group the circuit instructions into annotated boxes. This gives an easy alternative to manually grouping and annotating circuits, and is useful for automating a workflow, testing different circuit boxing strategies, and so on.\n"
msgstr "La fonction [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") est un outil flexible et pratique pour construire un [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) capable de regrouper les instructions du circuit en boxes annotées. Cela offre une alternative simple au regroupement et à l'annotation manuels des circuits, et est utile pour automatiser un workflow, tester différentes stratégies de mise en boxes des circuits, etc.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide illustrates how to use [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") and its arguments. To highlight the effects of each of the function’s arguments, the following sections mainly refer to the circuit below.\n"
msgstr "Ce guide illustre comment utiliser [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") et ses arguments. Pour mettre en évidence les effets de chacun des arguments de la fonction, les sections suivantes se réfèrent principalement au circuit ci-dessous.\n"

